		{"s": "nico", "t": "Stop right there! Name, dorm and... no. No names. No dorms. That is the whole point. I keep forgetting my own script.", "do": "chat"},
		{"s": "lumen", "t": "That is Nico. In a mask. With a megaphone that does not work."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "I am not Nico. I am the Voice of the Midnight Circle. Nico is asleep in Room Two. Ask anybody.", "cam": "close"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Here is how it goes. Jackets stay outside. Everybody wears a mask and picks a name. In here a Red and a Blue are the same thing: somebody with a deck.", "cam": "low"},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Twelve duels to the top of the wall, in three ranks. Candle, Lantern, Midnight. You start with no candle at all."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "And every night has a house rule, chalked on the door. One duel a night. Lose, and you come back another night. The wall is patient."},
		{"s": "nico", "t": "Nobody plays for cards or for merits. You play to get your name on that wall. So. What do I chalk?", "cam": "close"},
